    values:originalText "Insert: Australian law means: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (a) an Act of the Commonwealth or of a State or Territory; or  (b) regulations, or any other instrument, made under such an Act; or  (c) a Norfolk Island enactment; or  (d) a rule of common law or equity." ;
