concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Subsection 6(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: court/tribunal order means an order, direction or other instrument made by:  (a) a court; or  (b) a tribunal; or  (c) a judge (including a judge acting in a personal capacity) or a person acting as a judge; or  (d) a magistrate (including a magistrate acting in a personal capacity) or a person acting as a magistrate; or  (e) a member or an officer of a tribunal; and includes an order, direction or other instrument that is of an interim or interlocutory nature. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Australian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: court/tribunal order means an order, direction or other instrument made by:  (a) a court; or  (b) a tribunal; or  (c) a judge (including a judge acting in a personal capacity) or a person acting as a judge; or  (d) a magistrate (including a magistrate acting in a personal capacity) or a person acting as a magistrate; or  (e) a member or an officer of a tribunal; and includes an order, direction or other instrument that is of an interim or interlocutory nature. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Australian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
