concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-22 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22 Subsection 6(1) (definition of generally available"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-22 ;
    values:originalText "publication) Repeal the definition, substitute: generally available publication means a magazine, book, article, newspaper or other publication that is, or will be, generally available to members of the public:  (a) whether or not it is published in print, electronically or in any other form; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Australian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) whether or not it is available on the payment of a fee." ;
    skos:definition "publication) Repeal the definition, substitute: generally available publication means a magazine, book, article, newspaper or other publication that is, or will be, generally available to members of the public:  (a) whether or not it is published in print, electronically or in any other form; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Australian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) whether or not it is available on the payment of a fee."@en ;
