concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Personal, family or household affairs"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16-2 ;
    values:originalText "Nothing in the Australian Privacy Principles applies to:  (a) the collection, holding, use or disclosure of personal information by an individual; or  (b) personal information held by an individual; only for the purposes of, or in connection with, his or her personal, family or household affairs." ;
    skos:definition "Nothing in the Australian Privacy Principles applies to:  (a) the collection, holding, use or disclosure of personal information by an individual; or  (b) personal information held by an individual; only for the purposes of, or in connection with, his or her personal, family or household affairs."@en ;
