concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5 cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-5-logic-deontic-2 .
