concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-2-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 2 Subclause 2.1 does not apply if, in relation to that matter:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2-5 ;
    values:originalText "(a) the APP entity is required or authorised by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, to deal with individuals who have identified themselves; or  (b) it is impracticable for the APP entity to deal with individuals who have not identified themselves or who have used a pseudonym." ;
    skos:definition "(a) the APP entity is required or authorised by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, to deal with individuals who have identified themselves; or  (b) it is impracticable for the APP entity to deal with individuals who have not identified themselves or who have used a pseudonym."@en ;
