concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-3-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 6 An APP entity must collect personal information about an"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3-8 ;
    values:originalText "individual only from the individual unless:  (a) if the entity is an agency:  (i) the individual consents to the collection of the information from someone other than the individual; or  (ii) the entity is required or authorised by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, to collect the information from someone other than the individual; or  (b) it is unreasonable or impracticable to do so. Solicited personal information" ;
