    cof:title "6 3 This subclause applies in relation to the disclosure of personal" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "information about an individual by an APP entity that is an agency if:  (a) the agency is not an enforcement body; and  (b) the information is biometric information or biometric templates; and  (c) the recipient of the information is an enforcement body; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (d) the disclosure is conducted in accordance with the guidelines made by the Commissioner for the purposes of this paragraph." ;
    cof:pageNumber "39"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-6-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 4 If:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6-6 ;
    values:originalText "(a) the APP entity is an organisation; and  (b) subsection 16B(2) applied in relation to the collection of the personal information by the entity; the entity must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to ensure that the information is de-identified before the entity discloses it in accordance with subclause 6.1 or 6.2. Written note of use or disclosure" ;
    skos:definition "(a) the APP entity is an organisation; and  (b) subsection 16B(2) applied in relation to the collection of the personal information by the entity; the entity must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to ensure that the information is de-identified before the entity discloses it in accordance with subclause 6.1 or 6.2. Written note of use or disclosure"@en ;
