concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-7-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 7 If an individual makes a request under subclause 7.6, the first"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7-9 ;
    values:originalText "organisation must not charge the individual for the making of, or to give effect to, the request and:  (a) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(c) or (d)—the first organisation must give effect to the request within a reasonable period after the request is made; and  (b) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(e)—the organisation must, within a reasonable period after the request is made, notify the individual of its source unless it is impracticable or unreasonable to do so. Interaction with other legislation" ;
    skos:definition "organisation must not charge the individual for the making of, or to give effect to, the request and:  (a) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(c) or (d)—the first organisation must give effect to the request within a reasonable period after the request is made; and  (b) if the request is of a kind referred to in paragraph 7.6(e)—the organisation must, within a reasonable period after the request is made, notify the individual of its source unless it is impracticable or unreasonable to do so. Interaction with other legislation"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1d07004dadf488fb87d9e6c74ccefa3baebb254d7a5f83765b2f4f5527f402b1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Organisation must not charge individual for request making and give effect to request within reasonable period." ;
