    values:originalText "an individual as its own identifier of the individual unless:  (a) the adoption of the government related identifier is required or authorised by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order; or  (b) subclause 9.3 applies in relation to the adoption. Note: An act or practice of an agency may be treated as an act or practice of an organisation, see section 7A. Use or disclosure of government related identifiers" ;
    skos:definition "an individual as its own identifier of the individual unless:  (a) the adoption of the government related identifier is required or authorised by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order; or  (b) subclause 9.3 applies in relation to the adoption. Note: An act or practice of an agency may be treated as an act or practice of an organisation, see section 7A. Use or disclosure of government related identifiers"@en ;
