concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-1-sec-12-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 2 If:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12-4 ;
    values:originalText "(a) the APP entity is an agency; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) the entity is required or authorised to refuse to give the individual access to the personal information by or under:  (i) the Freedom of Information Act; or  (ii) any other Act of the Commonwealth, or a Norfolk Island enactment, that provides for access by persons to documents; then, despite subclause 12.1, the entity is not required to give access to the extent that the entity is required or authorised to refuse to give access. Exception to access—organisation" ;
    skos:definition "(a) the APP entity is an agency; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) the entity is required or authorised to refuse to give the individual access to the personal information by or under:  (i) the Freedom of Information Act; or  (ii) any other Act of the Commonwealth, or a Norfolk Island enactment, that provides for access by persons to documents; then, despite subclause 12.1, the entity is not required to give access to the extent that the entity is required or authorised to refuse to give access. Exception to access—organisation"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4aae10bc6be359448a6dda67f5f49f92ea6e3bac59df01a3816957e258c7764c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "47"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Entity may refuse access to personal information under certain conditions." ;
