    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(a) the APP entity is an organisation; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) the entity charges the individual for giving access to the personal information; the charge must not be excessive and must not apply to the making of the request. Refusal to give access" ;
