concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Subsection 6(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: commercial credit related purpose of a credit provider in relation to a person means the purpose of:  (a) assessing an application for commercial credit made by the person to the provider; or  (b) collecting payments that are overdue in relation to commercial credit provided by the provider to the person." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: commercial credit related purpose of a credit provider in relation to a person means the purpose of:  (a) assessing an application for commercial credit made by the person to the provider; or  (b) collecting payments that are overdue in relation to commercial credit provided by the provider to the person."@en ;
