    values:originalText "Insert: CRB derived information about an individual means any personal information (other than sensitive information) about the individual:  (a) that is derived by a credit reporting body from credit information about the individual that is held by the body; and  (b) that has any bearing on the individual’s credit worthiness; and  (c) that is used, has been used or could be used in establishing the individual’s eligibility for consumer credit." ;
