    values:originalText "Insert: credit eligibility information about an individual means:  (a) credit reporting information about the individual that was disclosed to a credit provider by a credit reporting body under Division 2 of Part IIIA; or  (b) CP derived information about the individual. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer .

