    skos:prefLabel "20 Subsection 6(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: credit guarantee purpose of a credit provider in relation to an individual means the purpose of assessing whether to accept the individual as a guarantor in relation to:  (a) credit provided by the provider to a person other than the individual; or  (b) credit for which an application has been made to the provider by a person other than the individual." ;
