concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-40 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Subsection 6(1) (definition of mortgage credit)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-40 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: mortgage credit means consumer credit:  (a) that is provided in connection with the acquisition, maintenance, renovation or improvement of real property; and  (b) in relation to which the real property is security." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the definition, substitute: mortgage credit means consumer credit:  (a) that is provided in connection with the acquisition, maintenance, renovation or improvement of real property; and  (b) in relation to which the real property is security."@en ;
