concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6k-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6K(3) Acquisition of the rights of a credit provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-6k-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If subsection (1) of this section applies in relation to credit for which an application has been made to the original credit provider, the application is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to have been made to the acquirer. Subdivision B—Other definitions" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If subsection (1) of this section applies in relation to credit for which an application has been made to the original credit provider, the application is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to have been made to the acquirer. Subdivision B—Other definitions"@en ;
