concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6L Meaning of access seeker"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-6l ;
    values:originalText "(1) An access seeker in relation to credit reporting information, or credit eligibility information, about an individual is:  (a) the individual; or  (b) a person:  (i) who is assisting the individual to deal with a credit reporting body or credit provider; and  (ii) who is authorised, in writing, by the individual to make a request in relation to the information under subsection 20R(1) or 21T(1).  (2) An individual must not authorise a person under subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:  (a) a credit provider; or  (b) a mortgage insurer; or  (c) a trade insurer; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by subsection 6G(5) or (6).  (3) Subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) does not apply to a person who provides the National Relay Service or a person prescribed by the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An access seeker in relation to credit reporting information, or credit eligibility information, about an individual is:  (a) the individual; or  (b) a person:  (i) who is assisting the individual to deal with a credit reporting body or credit provider; and  (ii) who is authorised, in writing, by the individual to make a request in relation to the information under subsection 20R(1) or 21T(1).  (2) An individual must not authorise a person under subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:  (a) a credit provider; or  (b) a mortgage insurer; or  (c) a trade insurer; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by subsection 6G(5) or (6).  (3) Subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) does not apply to a person who provides the National Relay Service or a person prescribed by the regulations."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f177004dcda3400a087376806831db761e0cc051c7ca4f269aa52ec5ebd89e23" ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-6l-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
