    skos:definition "(2) An individual must not authorise a person under subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) if the person is:  (a) a credit provider; or  (b) a mortgage insurer; or  (c) a trade insurer; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (d) a person who is prevented from being a credit provider by subsection 6G(5) or (6)."@en ;
