    values:originalText "This Division sets out rules that apply to credit reporting bodies in relation to their handling of the following:  (a) credit reporting information;  (b) CP derived information;  (c) credit reporting information that is de-identified;  (d) a pre-screening assessment. The rules apply in relation to that kind of information or assessment instead of the Australian Privacy Principles." ;
