concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20A Application of this Division and the Australian Privacy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20a ;
    values:originalText "Principles to credit reporting bodies  (1) This Division applies to a credit reporting body in relation to the following:  (a) credit reporting information;  (b) CP derived information;  (c) credit reporting information that is de-identified;  (d) a pre-screening assessment.  (2) The Australian Privacy Principles do not apply to a credit reporting body in relation to personal information that is:  (a) credit reporting information; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) CP derived information; or  (c) a pre-screening assessment. Note: The Australian Privacy Principles apply to the credit reporting body in relation to other kinds of personal information. Subdivision B—Consideration of information privacy" ;
    skos:definition "Principles to credit reporting bodies  (1) This Division applies to a credit reporting body in relation to the following:  (a) credit reporting information;  (b) CP derived information;  (c) credit reporting information that is de-identified;  (d) a pre-screening assessment.  (2) The Australian Privacy Principles do not apply to a credit reporting body in relation to personal information that is:  (a) credit reporting information; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) CP derived information; or  (c) a pre-screening assessment. Note: The Australian Privacy Principles apply to the credit reporting body in relation to other kinds of personal information. Subdivision B—Consideration of information privacy"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eb4de01e616931d13ef9a5b41eb7223f5e589ed742a39e7000c5e65d76641a00" ;
    cof:pageNumber "79"^^xsd:integer ;
