doc:sch-2-sec-20b-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20B(2) Open and transparent management of credit reporting" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A credit reporting body must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to implement practices, procedures and systems relating to the credit reporting business of the body that:  (a) will ensure that the body complies with this Division and the registered CR code; and  (b) will enable the body to deal with inquiries or complaints from individuals about the body’s compliance with this Division or the registered CR code. Policy about the management of credit reporting information" ;
