concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20b-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20B(6) Open and transparent management of credit reporting"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20b-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If a person or body requests a copy, in a particular form, of the policy of a credit reporting body, the credit reporting body must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to give the person or body a copy in that form. Subdivision C—Collection of credit information" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If a person or body requests a copy, in a particular form, of the policy of a credit reporting body, the credit reporting body must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to give the person or body a copy in that form. Subdivision C—Collection of credit information"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ddac24c392f15df918643b2a7e7c35db761836c7ae19b8c90dcddf3343029288" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20b ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Credit reporting body must provide a copy of its policy in a requested form." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
