concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20c-ss-4 cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20c-ss-4-logic-ltl-2 .
