doc:sch-2-sec-20n-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20N(2) Quality of credit reporting information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A credit reporting body must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to ensure that the credit reporting information the body uses or discloses is, having regard to the purpose of the use or disclosure, accurate, up-to-date, complete and relevant." ;
