concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20p a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20P False or misleading credit reporting information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20p ;
    values:originalText "Offence  (1) A credit reporting body commits an offence if:  (a) the body uses or discloses credit reporting information under this Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and 20T(4)); and  (b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular. Penalty: 200 penalty units. Civil penalty  (2) A credit reporting body must not use or disclose credit reporting information under this Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  20T(4)) if the information is false or misleading in a material particular. Civil penalty: 2,000 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "Offence  (1) A credit reporting body commits an offence if:  (a) the body uses or discloses credit reporting information under this Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and 20T(4)); and  (b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular. Penalty: 200 penalty units. Civil penalty  (2) A credit reporting body must not use or disclose credit reporting information under this Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  20T(4)) if the information is false or misleading in a material particular. Civil penalty: 2,000 penalty units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cd25b8565d4b57e8f856cf50c696d80d49eb0c79087d2888c0de2bddefadce7e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "93"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20p-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20p-ss-2 ;
