doc:sch-2-sec-20q-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20Q(1) Security of credit reporting information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a credit reporting body holds credit reporting information, the body must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to protect the information:  (a) from misuse, interference and loss; and  (b) from unauthorised access, modification or disclosure." ;
    cof:pageNumber "94"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20q-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20Q(2) Security of credit reporting information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20q-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a credit reporting body must:  (a) enter into agreements with credit providers that require the providers to protect credit reporting information that is disclosed to them under this Division:  (i) from misuse, interference and loss; and  (ii) from unauthorised access, modification or disclosure; and  (b) ensure that regular audits are conducted by an independent person to determine whether those agreements are being complied with; and  (c) identify and deal with suspected breaches of those agreements. Subdivision F—Access to, and correction of, information" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a credit reporting body must:  (a) enter into agreements with credit providers that require the providers to protect credit reporting information that is disclosed to them under this Division:  (i) from misuse, interference and loss; and  (ii) from unauthorised access, modification or disclosure; and  (b) ensure that regular audits are conducted by an independent person to determine whether those agreements are being complied with; and  (c) identify and deal with suspected breaches of those agreements. Subdivision F—Access to, and correction of, information"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b2a26f3794cfd6508725bef4abac396d5d2ca629015ce38b4c2bc7d2411b4826" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20q ;
    cof:pageNumber "94"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Protect credit reporting information from misuse, interference, loss, unauthorized access, modification or disclosure." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.94" ;
    cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20q-ss-2-norm .
