concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20r-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20R(6) Access to credit reporting information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20r-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If subsection (5) does not apply, any charge by the credit reporting body for giving access to the information must not be excessive and must not apply to the making of the request. Refusal to give access" ;
