concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20r-ss-7 cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20r-ss-7-logic-deontic-4 .
