doc:sch-2-sec-20s-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20S(2) Correction of credit reporting information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) the credit reporting body corrects credit reporting information under subsection (1); and  (b) the body has previously disclosed the information under this Division (other than subsections 20D(2) and 20T(4)); the body must, within a reasonable period, give each recipient of the information written notice of the correction." ;
