concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20s-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20S(3) Correction of credit reporting information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20s-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if:  (a) it is impracticable for the credit reporting body to give the notice under that subsection; or  (b) the credit reporting body is required by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, not to give the notice under that subsection. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  20T  Individual may request the correction of credit information etc. Request" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if:  (a) it is impracticable for the credit reporting body to give the notice under that subsection; or  (b) the credit reporting body is required by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, not to give the notice under that subsection. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  20T  Individual may request the correction of credit information etc. Request"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4b8fa155fd624f10358cdfc73ab7e78abb3c53837b2ff8aceb251540b3c0ad4e" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20s ;
