concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20s-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20S(1) Correction of credit reporting information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20s-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An individual may request a credit reporting body to correct personal information about the individual if:  (a) the personal information is:  (i) credit information about the individual; or  (ii) CRB derived information about the individual; or  (iii) CP derived information about the individual; and  (b) the body holds at least one kind of the personal information referred to in paragraph (a). Correction" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An individual may request a credit reporting body to correct personal information about the individual if:  (a) the personal information is:  (i) credit information about the individual; or  (ii) CRB derived information about the individual; or  (iii) CP derived information about the individual; and  (b) the body holds at least one kind of the personal information referred to in paragraph (a). Correction"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "344f07a73def634c907b15b35fb066db2e8fa13b8bf232db3c75e6c48e77c435" ;
