concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20s-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20S(4) Correction of credit reporting information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20s-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The use or disclosure of personal information about the individual for the purposes of the consultation is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to be a use or disclosure that is authorised by this subsection. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  No charge" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The use or disclosure of personal information about the individual for the purposes of the consultation is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to be a use or disclosure that is authorised by this subsection. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  No charge"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3237a448a469dc9532744c755b0e7f9cf8d5d56af8045b3fd43c2ee759530a03" ;
