    values:originalText "(2) The credit reporting body must:  (a) destroy the credit reporting information; and  (b) within a reasonable period after the information is destroyed:  (i) give the individual a written notice that states that the information has been destroyed and sets out the effect of subsection (4); and  (ii) give the credit provider a written notice that states that the information has been destroyed. Civil penalty: 1,000 penalty units." ;
