concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-20z-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20Z(5) Dealing with information if there is a pending correction"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20z-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the credit reporting body uses or discloses the information under subsection (4), the body must make a written note of the use or disclosure. Civil penalty: 500 penalty units. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Direction to destroy information etc." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If the credit reporting body uses or discloses the information under subsection (4), the body must make a written note of the use or disclosure. Civil penalty: 500 penalty units. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Direction to destroy information etc."@en ;
