    cof:title "20ZA(5) Dealing with information if an Australian law etc. requires it" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subdivision E of this Division (other than section 20Q) does not apply in relation to the use or disclosure of the information. Note: Section 20Q deals with the security of credit reporting information." ;
    cof:pageNumber "106"^^xsd:integer .

