concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21A(6) Application of this Division to credit providers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If a person or body requests a copy, in a particular form, of the policy of a credit provider, the provider must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to give the person or body a copy in that form. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Interaction with the Australian Privacy Principles" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If a person or body requests a copy, in a particular form, of the policy of a credit provider, the provider must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to give the person or body a copy in that form. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Interaction with the Australian Privacy Principles"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6fb7bae1072dae00d9c1cc5d24213709f315d2c9c7bc93347096ec1e109e9f90" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21a ;
    cof:pageNumber "107"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Credit provider must provide a copy of policy in a particular form upon request." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
