concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21d-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21D(7) Disclosure of credit information to a credit reporting body"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21d-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principles 6 and 8 do not apply to the disclosure by the provider of credit information to a credit reporting body." ;
    skos:definition "(7) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principles 6 and 8 do not apply to the disclosure by the provider of credit information to a credit reporting body."@en ;
