concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21g-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21G(6) Use or disclosure of credit eligibility information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21g-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If a credit provider uses or discloses credit eligibility information under this section, the provider must make a written note of that use or disclosure. Civil penalty: 500 penalty units. Interaction with the Australian Privacy Principles" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If a credit provider uses or discloses credit eligibility information under this section, the provider must make a written note of that use or disclosure. Civil penalty: 500 penalty units. Interaction with the Australian Privacy Principles"@en ;
