concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21g-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21G(8) Use or disclosure of credit eligibility information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21g-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) If:  (a) a credit provider is an APP entity; and  (b) the credit eligibility information is a government related identifier of the individual; Australian Privacy Principle 9.2 does not apply to the provider in relation to the information." ;
