    skos:definition "(2) The consent of the individual under paragraph (1)(c):  (a) must be given in writing unless:  (i) the disclosure of the information to the recipient is for the purpose of assessing an application for consumer credit or commercial credit made to the recipient; and  (ii) the application has not been made in writing; and  (b) must be given to the credit provider or recipient. Agents of credit providers"@en ;
