doc:sch-2-sec-21j-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "21J(3) Permitted CP disclosures between credit providers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A disclosure by a credit provider of credit eligibility information about an individual is a permitted CP disclosure in relation to the individual if:  (a) the provider is acting as an agent of another credit provider that has an Australian link; and  (b) while the provider is so acting, the provider is a credit provider under subsection 6H(1); and  (c) the provider discloses the information to the other credit provider in the provider’s capacity as such an agent. Securitisation arrangements etc." ;
