concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21j-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21J(2) Permitted CP disclosures between credit providers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21j-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The consent of the individual under paragraph (1)(d) must be given in writing unless:  (a) if subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies—the application for the credit was not made in writing; or  (b) if subparagraph (1)(a)(ii) applies—the application for the credit has not been made in writing. Guarantors etc." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The consent of the individual under paragraph (1)(d) must be given in writing unless:  (a) if subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies—the application for the credit was not made in writing; or  (b) if subparagraph (1)(a)(ii) applies—the application for the credit has not been made in writing. Guarantors etc."@en ;
