doc:sch-2-sec-21u-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "21U(1) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An individual may request a credit provider to correct personal information about the individual if:  (a) the personal information is:  (i) credit information about the individual; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (ii) CRB derived information about the individual; or  (iii) CP derived information about the individual; and  (b) the provider holds at least one kind of the personal information referred to in paragraph (a). Correction" ;
    cof:pageNumber "129"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21U(2) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21u-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the credit provider is satisfied that the personal information is inaccurate, out-of-date, incomplete, irrelevant or misleading, the provider must take such steps (if any) as are reasonable in the circumstances to correct the information within:  (a) the period of 30 days that starts on the day on which the request is made; or  (b) such longer period as the individual has agreed to in writing. Consultation" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If the credit provider is satisfied that the personal information is inaccurate, out-of-date, incomplete, irrelevant or misleading, the provider must take such steps (if any) as are reasonable in the circumstances to correct the information within:  (a) the period of 30 days that starts on the day on which the request is made; or  (b) such longer period as the individual has agreed to in writing. Consultation"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "52f489fe514978bc11b84a6c15b62aae2b42279637b2f1326f4cec970a0a7bde" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u ;
    cof:pageNumber "129"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Credit provider must correct personal information within a specified period. Provider must give written notice of correction within a reasonable period." ;
    dc:description "Correcting personal information" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
