concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21U(3) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21u-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the credit provider considers that the provider cannot be satisfied of the matter referred to in subsection (2) in relation to the personal information without consulting either or both of the following (the interested party):  (a) a credit reporting body that holds or held the information and that has an Australian link;  (b) another credit provider that holds or held the information and that has an Australian link; the provider must consult that interested party, or those interested parties, about the individual’s request." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the credit provider considers that the provider cannot be satisfied of the matter referred to in subsection (2) in relation to the personal information without consulting either or both of the following (the interested party):  (a) a credit reporting body that holds or held the information and that has an Australian link;  (b) another credit provider that holds or held the information and that has an Australian link; the provider must consult that interested party, or those interested parties, about the individual’s request."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fd9d057c2ab1480ace9d129fdf82faf64e7e38e84ded9ceec6cda0118828ca69" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u ;
    cof:pageNumber "129"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Credit provider must consult interested party about individual's request. Credit provider must give notice under subsection (2) if able to do so." ;
    dc:description "Consultation with interested parties" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
