concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21U(4) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21u-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The use or disclosure of personal information about the individual for the purposes of the consultation is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to be a use or disclosure that is authorised by this subsection. No charge" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The use or disclosure of personal information about the individual for the purposes of the consultation is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to be a use or disclosure that is authorised by this subsection. No charge"@en ;
