concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21U(6) Correction of credit information or credit eligibility"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21u-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle 13:  (a) applies to the provider in relation to personal information referred to in paragraph (1)(a) that is identification information; but  (b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of personal information referred to in that paragraph. Note: Identification information may be corrected under this section or Australian Privacy Principle 13." ;
    skos:definition "(6) If a credit provider is an APP entity, Australian Privacy Principle 13:  (a) applies to the provider in relation to personal information referred to in paragraph (1)(a) that is identification information; but  (b) does not apply to the provider in relation to any other kind of personal information referred to in that paragraph. Note: Identification information may be corrected under this section or Australian Privacy Principle 13."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5352c0d217d069825c947ed9f8f68ae7f06600d997090f211b3e5fe6404239a9" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21u ;
    cof:pageNumber "129"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Credit provider must comply with Australian Privacy Principle 13 for personal information referred to in paragraph (1)(a) that is identification information." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
