    skos:definition "(1) If: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (a) a mortgage insurer or trade insurer holds or held personal information about an individual; and  (b) the information was disclosed to the insurer by a credit reporting body or credit provider under Division 2 or 3 of this Part; the insurer must not use or disclose the information, or any personal information about the individual derived from that information. Civil penalty: 2,000 penalty units. Permitted uses"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ea19978897611c01b019fc4c253aecf5be4cdcadfc145cadb8a7a5cfcd4ee2f7" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22c ;
