concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22c-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22c-ss-1-logic-deontic-1 .
