concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22D(5) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22d-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (a) the body corporate is an APP entity; and  (b) the information is a government related identifier of the individual; Australian Privacy Principle 9.2 does not apply to the body in relation to the information. 22E  Use or disclosure of information by credit managers etc. Prohibition on use or disclosure" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (a) the body corporate is an APP entity; and  (b) the information is a government related identifier of the individual; Australian Privacy Principle 9.2 does not apply to the body in relation to the information. 22E  Use or disclosure of information by credit managers etc. Prohibition on use or disclosure"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5d65da4e42fce3e71d2398371f960d8b091fb655c0a3aa649c2bdaea36b99b7e" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Recipient is exempt from APPII if an APP entity and the information is a government related identifier of the individual. Prohibition on use or disclosure of government related identifiers by APP entities Prohibition on use or disclosure of government related identifier information by APP entities" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
