doc:sch-2-sec-22d-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22D(5) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (a) the body corporate is an APP entity; and  (b) the information is a government related identifier of the individual; Australian Privacy Principle 9.2 does not apply to the body in relation to the information. 22E  Use or disclosure of information by credit managers etc. Prohibition on use or disclosure" ;
