concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22D(5) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22d-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If:  (a) the person is an APP entity; and  (b) the information is a government related identifier of the individual; Australian Privacy Principle 9.2 does not apply to the person in relation to the information. 22F  Use or disclosure of information by advisers etc. Prohibition on use or disclosure" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If:  (a) the person is an APP entity; and  (b) the information is a government related identifier of the individual; Australian Privacy Principle 9.2 does not apply to the person in relation to the information. 22F  Use or disclosure of information by advisers etc. Prohibition on use or disclosure"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "71dc62f1cf3ecf49d1401b6ab21df843aa5d3b7a94a802dcdfa50925439ec58f" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Recipient is exempt from APPII if an APP entity and the information is a government related identifier of the individual. Prohibition on use or disclosure of government related identifiers by APP entities Prohibition on use or disclosure of government related identifier information by APP entities" ;
