doc:sch-2-sec-22d-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22D(1) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) any of the following (the recipient) holds or held credit eligibility information about an individual:  (i) an entity;  (ii) a professional legal adviser of the entity;  (iii) a professional financial adviser of the entity; and  (b) the information was disclosed to the recipient by a credit provider under subsection 21N(2); the recipient must not use or disclose the information, or any personal information about the individual derived from that information. Civil penalty: 1,000 penalty units. Permitted uses" ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22D(2) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22d-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to the use of the information if:  (a) for a recipient that is the entity—the information is used for a matter referred to in subsection 21N(3); or  (b) for a recipient that is the professional legal adviser, or professional financial adviser, of the entity—the information is used:  (i) in the adviser’s capacity as an adviser of the entity; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (ii) in connection with advising the entity about a matter referred to in subsection 21N(3); or  (c) the use is required or authorised by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order. Permitted disclosure" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to the use of the information if:  (a) for a recipient that is the entity—the information is used for a matter referred to in subsection 21N(3); or  (b) for a recipient that is the professional legal adviser, or professional financial adviser, of the entity—the information is used:  (i) in the adviser’s capacity as an adviser of the entity; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (ii) in connection with advising the entity about a matter referred to in subsection 21N(3); or  (c) the use is required or authorised by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order. Permitted disclosure"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "22cf71a40361744d2d2c48a9a4185ef4c90a235209cbe4237a048207f26de00e" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Permits use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate under certain conditions. Permitted disclosure of information Permitted disclosure of information under certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.137" ;
    cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-22d-ss-2-norm .
