doc:sch-2-sec-22d-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22D(2) Use or disclosure of information by a related body corporate" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to the use of the information if:  (a) for a recipient that is the entity—the information is used for a matter referred to in subsection 21N(3); or  (b) for a recipient that is the professional legal adviser, or professional financial adviser, of the entity—the information is used:  (i) in the adviser’s capacity as an adviser of the entity; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (ii) in connection with advising the entity about a matter referred to in subsection 21N(3); or  (c) the use is required or authorised by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order. Permitted disclosure" ;
