concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-23-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Guide to this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23-2 ;
    values:originalText "This Division deals with complaints about credit reporting bodies or credit providers. Individuals may complain to credit reporting bodies or credit providers about acts or practices that may be a breach of certain provisions of this Part or the registered CR code. If a complaint is made, the respondent for the complaint must investigate the complaint and make a decision about the complaint. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "This Division deals with complaints about credit reporting bodies or credit providers. Individuals may complain to credit reporting bodies or credit providers about acts or practices that may be a breach of certain provisions of this Part or the registered CR code. If a complaint is made, the respondent for the complaint must investigate the complaint and make a decision about the complaint. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c8859e1894df7885ec9e0b97a9123f202a4b03cb3124cee4f96d474950de12b5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Individuals may complain to credit reporting bodies or credit providers about acts or practices that may be a breach of certain provisions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.140" ;
    cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-23-2-norm .
