concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-23a-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23A(5) Individual may complain about a breach of a provision of this"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23a-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The credit reporting body or credit provider must not charge the individual for the making of the complaint or for dealing with the complaint. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The credit reporting body or credit provider must not charge the individual for the making of the complaint or for dealing with the complaint. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4f59bf93f1f31475d2e7924bc8cfe17554285b0d6da01448b85b2366bda1a292" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-23a ;
