    values:originalText "(1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and  (b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and  (c) the entity is not: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Credit reporting  Schedule 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (i) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the information under Division 2 of this Part; or  (ii) an access seeker for the information. Penalty: 200 penalty units." ;
