doc:sch-2-sec-24a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "24A(1) Obtaining credit eligibility information from a credit provider" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity obtains credit eligibility information; and  (b) the information is obtained from a credit provider; and  (c) the entity is not:  (i) an entity to which the provider is permitted to disclose the information under Division 3 of this Part; or  (ii) an access seeker for the information. Penalty: 200 penalty units. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 2  Credit reporting  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    cof:pageNumber "145"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-24a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24A(2) Obtaining credit eligibility information from a credit provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-24a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity obtains credit eligibility information; and  (b) the information is obtained from a credit provider; and  (c) the information is obtained by false pretence. Penalty: 200 penalty units. Civil penalties" ;
    skos:definition "(2) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity obtains credit eligibility information; and  (b) the information is obtained from a credit provider; and  (c) the information is obtained by false pretence. Penalty: 200 penalty units. Civil penalties"@en ;
