concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-2-sec-25a-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25A(5) Other orders to compensate loss or damage"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-25a-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the court makes an order that the entity pay an amount to the person, the person may recover the amount as a debt due to the person." ;
