concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26e-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26E(6) Development of APP codes by APP code developers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26e-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Despite paragraph (5)(a), the Commissioner must not require an APP code to cover an act or practice that is exempt within the meaning of subsection 7B(1), (2) or (3). However, the APP code that is developed by the APP code developer may cover such an act or practice." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Despite paragraph (5)(a), the Commissioner must not require an APP code to cover an act or practice that is exempt within the meaning of subsection 7B(1), (2) or (3). However, the APP code that is developed by the APP code developer may cover such an act or practice."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "74728eee7ef7b2cc63595af194f245a8b6c537268f257a9d63ebd6808e0c6cdb" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26e ;
    cof:pageNumber "155"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner cannot require APP code to cover exempt act or practice." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
