concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26f-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26F(4) Application for registration of APP codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26f-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The APP code developer may vary the APP code at any time before the Commissioner registers the code, but only with the consent of the Commissioner. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Privacy codes  Schedule 3  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
