concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26H Commissioner may register APP codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26h ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) an application for registration of an APP code is made under section 26F; or  (b) the Commissioner develops an APP code under section 26G; the Commissioner may register the code by including it on the Codes Register.  (2) In deciding whether to register the APP code, the Commissioner may:  (a) consult any person the Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (b) consider the matters specified in any relevant guidelines made under section 26V. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 3  Privacy codes  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (3) If the Commissioner decides not to register an APP code developed by an APP code developer, the Commissioner must give written notice of the decision to the developer, including reasons for the decision. Subdivision C—Variation and removal of registered APP codes" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) an application for registration of an APP code is made under section 26F; or  (b) the Commissioner develops an APP code under section 26G; the Commissioner may register the code by including it on the Codes Register.  (2) In deciding whether to register the APP code, the Commissioner may:  (a) consult any person the Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (b) consider the matters specified in any relevant guidelines made under section 26V. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 3  Privacy codes  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (3) If the Commissioner decides not to register an APP code developed by an APP code developer, the Commissioner must give written notice of the decision to the developer, including reasons for the decision. Subdivision C—Variation and removal of registered APP codes"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c4fe29200d990b0a06fa31ccd13b76353cef21cdfd7744868404e7a6729f5625" ;
    cof:pageNumber "157"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26h-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26h-ss-2 ;
