concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26J(6) Variation of registered APP codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26j-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation of a registered APP code (the original code), the Commissioner must:  (a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and  (b) register the APP code, as varied, by including it on the Register." ;
    skos:definition "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation of a registered APP code (the original code), the Commissioner must:  (a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and  (b) register the APP code, as varied, by including it on the Register."@en ;
