doc:sch-3-sec-26p-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26P(2) Development of CR code by CR code developers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The request must:  (a) specify the period within which the request must be complied with; and  (b) set out the effect of section 26L." ;
    cof:pageNumber "161"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26p-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26P(3) Development of CR code by CR code developers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26p-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The period:  (a) must run for at least 120 days from the date the request is made; and  (b) may be extended by the Commissioner. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 3  Privacy codes  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
