concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26p-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26P(4) Development of CR code by CR code developers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26p-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The request may:  (a) specify one or more matters that the CR code must deal with; and  (b) specify the credit providers, or a class of credit providers, that should be bound by the code; and  (c) specify the other entities, or a class of other entities, subject to Part IIIA that should be bound by the code." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The request may:  (a) specify one or more matters that the CR code must deal with; and  (b) specify the credit providers, or a class of credit providers, that should be bound by the code; and  (c) specify the other entities, or a class of other entities, subject to Part IIIA that should be bound by the code."@en ;
