concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26s a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26S Commissioner may register CR code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26s ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) an application for registration of a CR code is made under section 26Q; or  (b) the Commissioner develops a CR code under section 26R; the Commissioner may register the code by including it on the Codes Register.  (2) In deciding whether to register the CR code, the Commissioner may:  (a) consult any person the Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (b) consider the matters specified in any guidelines made under section 26V.  (3) If the Commissioner decides not to register a CR code developed by a CR code developer, the Commissioner must give written notice of the decision to the developer, including reasons for the decision.  (4) The Commissioner must ensure that there is one, and only one, registered CR code at all times after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 3  Privacy codes  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Subdivision C—Variation of the registered CR code" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) an application for registration of a CR code is made under section 26Q; or  (b) the Commissioner develops a CR code under section 26R; the Commissioner may register the code by including it on the Codes Register.  (2) In deciding whether to register the CR code, the Commissioner may:  (a) consult any person the Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (b) consider the matters specified in any guidelines made under section 26V.  (3) If the Commissioner decides not to register a CR code developed by a CR code developer, the Commissioner must give written notice of the decision to the developer, including reasons for the decision.  (4) The Commissioner must ensure that there is one, and only one, registered CR code at all times after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 3  Privacy codes  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Subdivision C—Variation of the registered CR code"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f722c807375faa79555fab6cc8fa9c4851ed34fd820a9c4ef398c83bbdec738f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "163"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26s-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26s-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26s-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26s-ss-4 ;
