doc:sch-3-sec-26s-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26S(3) Commissioner may register CR code" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the Commissioner decides not to register a CR code developed by a CR code developer, the Commissioner must give written notice of the decision to the developer, including reasons for the decision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "163"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26s-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26S(4) Commissioner may register CR code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26s-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Commissioner must ensure that there is one, and only one, registered CR code at all times after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 3  Privacy codes  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Subdivision C—Variation of the registered CR code" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Commissioner must ensure that there is one, and only one, registered CR code at all times after this Part commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 3  Privacy codes  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Subdivision C—Variation of the registered CR code"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "020f670cfca41a242f10434bc9ba924b852a4057d972cd4a1b01abf9e0fe0f96" ;
