doc:sch-3-sec-26t-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26T(5) Variation of the registered CR code" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the Commissioner approves a variation of the registered CR code (the original code), the Commissioner must:  (a) remove the original code from the Codes Register; and  (b) register the CR code, as varied, by including it on the Register." ;
    cof:pageNumber "164"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26t-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26T(6) Variation of the registered CR code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26t-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation, the variation comes into effect on the day specified in the approval, which must not be before the day on which the CR code, as varied, is included on the Codes Register. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Privacy codes  Schedule 3  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If the Commissioner approves a variation, the variation comes into effect on the day specified in the approval, which must not be before the day on which the CR code, as varied, is included on the Codes Register. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Privacy codes  Schedule 3  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
