concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-3-sec-26w a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26W Review of operation of registered codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26w ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of a registered APP code. Note: The review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a variation of a registered APP code or to remove a registered APP code from the Codes Register.  (2) The Commissioner may review the operation of the registered CR code. Note: The review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a variation of the registered CR code." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of a registered APP code. Note: The review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a variation of a registered APP code or to remove a registered APP code from the Codes Register.  (2) The Commissioner may review the operation of the registered CR code. Note: The review may inform a decision by the Commissioner to approve a variation of the registered CR code."@en ;
