    skos:prefLabel "2(1) Subsections 5B(1) and (1A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-2-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Act, a registered APP code and the registered CR code extend to an act done, or practice engaged in, outside Australia and the external Territories by an agency. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  Note: The act or practice overseas will not breach an Australian Privacy Principle or a registered APP code if the act or practice is required by an applicable foreign law (see sections 6A and 6B). Organisations and small business operators" ;
