doc:sch-4-sec-35-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "35(1) Subsections 12B(1) and (2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Without limiting its effect apart from this section, this Act has effect in relation to the following (the regulated entities) as provided by this section:  (a) an agency;  (b) an organisation;  (c) a small business operator;  (d) a body politic. Note: Subsection 27(4) applies in relation to an investigation of an act or practice referred to in subsection 29(1) of the Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010." ;
