concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-13g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13G Serious and repeated interferences with privacy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-13g ;
    values:originalText "An entity contravenes this subsection if:  (a) the entity does an act, or engages in a practice, that is a serious interference with the privacy of an individual; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) the entity repeatedly does an act, or engages in a practice, that is an interference with the privacy of one or more individuals. Civil penalty: 2,000 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "An entity contravenes this subsection if:  (a) the entity does an act, or engages in a practice, that is a serious interference with the privacy of an individual; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) the entity repeatedly does an act, or engages in a practice, that is an interference with the privacy of one or more individuals. Civil penalty: 2,000 penalty units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "afad3f05e1ec4a5bb3b7637af28abc5cfe8694f90d5a0435ba00f3655fb4e8ac" ;
    cof:pageNumber "177"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Serious and repeated interferences with privacy are prohibited." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.177" ;
