    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the Commissioner may establish a panel of persons with expertise in relation to a particular matter to assist the Commissioner in performing any of the Commissioner’s functions." ;
    cof:pageNumber "178"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-27-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27(4) Functions of the Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-27-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Section 38 of the Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010, rather than section 12B of this Act, applies in relation to an investigation of an act or practice referred to in subsection 29(1) of that Act in the same way as it applies to Parts 3 and 4 of that Act. Note: Section 38 of the Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010 deals with the additional effect of Parts 3 and 4 of that Act." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Section 38 of the Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010, rather than section 12B of this Act, applies in relation to an investigation of an act or practice referred to in subsection 29(1) of that Act in the same way as it applies to Parts 3 and 4 of that Act. Note: Section 38 of the Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010 deals with the additional effect of Parts 3 and 4 of that Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "92cbce97d13be363c4e9c39d217a19c1471fc69b2b728e5e64f978d64bf9e030" ;
