concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-62 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62 Subsection 32(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-62 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) If the Commissioner has:  (a) monitored an activity in the performance of a function under paragraph 28(1)(d), 28A(1)(a), (b), (d) or (e) or (2)(b), (c) or (d) or 28B(1)(b) or (c); or  (b) conducted an assessment under section 33C; the Commissioner may report to the Minister about the activity or assessment, and must do so if so directed by the Minister." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) If the Commissioner has:  (a) monitored an activity in the performance of a function under paragraph 28(1)(d), 28A(1)(a), (b), (d) or (e) or (2)(b), (c) or (d) or 28B(1)(b) or (c); or  (b) conducted an assessment under section 33C; the Commissioner may report to the Minister about the activity or assessment, and must do so if so directed by the Minister."@en ;
