concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-33f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33F Enforcement of undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-33f ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) an entity gives an undertaking under section 33E; and  (b) the undertaking has not been withdrawn or cancelled; and  (c) the Commissioner considers that the entity has breached the undertaking; the Commissioner may apply to the Federal Court or Federal Magistrates Court for an order under subsection (2).  (2) If the court is satisfied that the entity has breached the undertaking, the court may make any or all of the following orders:  (a) an order directing the entity to comply with the undertaking;  (b) any order that the court considers appropriate directing the person to compensate any other person who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the breach;  (c) any other order that the court considers appropriate. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) an entity gives an undertaking under section 33E; and  (b) the undertaking has not been withdrawn or cancelled; and  (c) the Commissioner considers that the entity has breached the undertaking; the Commissioner may apply to the Federal Court or Federal Magistrates Court for an order under subsection (2).  (2) If the court is satisfied that the entity has breached the undertaking, the court may make any or all of the following orders:  (a) an order directing the entity to comply with the undertaking;  (b) any order that the court considers appropriate directing the person to compensate any other person who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the breach;  (c) any other order that the court considers appropriate. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "831e95c9d4c19db718a59e95ff9dcc327df1ec14a0f43e288f84d8d5272df52f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-33f-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-33f-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.186" .
