doc:sch-4-sec-33f-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "33F(1) Enforcement of undertakings" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) an entity gives an undertaking under section 33E; and  (b) the undertaking has not been withdrawn or cancelled; and  (c) the Commissioner considers that the entity has breached the undertaking; the Commissioner may apply to the Federal Court or Federal Magistrates Court for an order under subsection (2)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-33f-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33F(2) Enforcement of undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-33f-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the court is satisfied that the entity has breached the undertaking, the court may make any or all of the following orders:  (a) an order directing the entity to comply with the undertaking;  (b) any order that the court considers appropriate directing the person to compensate any other person who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the breach;  (c) any other order that the court considers appropriate. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If the court is satisfied that the entity has breached the undertaking, the court may make any or all of the following orders:  (a) an order directing the entity to comply with the undertaking;  (b) any order that the court considers appropriate directing the person to compensate any other person who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the breach;  (c) any other order that the court considers appropriate. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c9079aad943696a1e13fd870978bd3726aa94b4a35e48ff4cb8dca2da66a7255" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-33f ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may order entity to comply with undertaking or compensate for breach." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
