concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-40a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40A(3) Conciliation of complaints"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-40a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the Commissioner is satisfied that there is no reasonable likelihood that the complaint will be resolved by conciliation, the Commissioner must, in writing, notify the complainant and respondent of that matter." ;
