    values:originalText "Add: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (2) The Commissioner may make inquiries of any person for the purpose of determining whether to investigate an act or practice under subsection 40(2)." ;
