    cof:title "43A(3) Interested party may request a hearing" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) In this section: interested party in relation to an investigation means:  (a) in the case of an investigation under subsection 40(1)—the complainant or respondent; or  (b) otherwise—the person or entity that engaged in the act or practice that is being investigated." ;
    cof:pageNumber "194"^^xsd:integer .

