concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-55-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55 Obligations of organisations and small business operators"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55-2 ;
    values:originalText "If the determination applies in relation to an organisation or small business operator, the organisation or operator:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration included in the determination under sub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B) or paragraph 52(1A)(a); and  (b) must take the steps that are specified in a declaration included in the determination under subparagraph 52(1)(b)(ia) or paragraph 52(1A)(b) within the specified period; and  (c) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration included in the determination under subparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii) or paragraph 52(1A)(c). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "If the determination applies in relation to an organisation or small business operator, the organisation or operator:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration included in the determination under sub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B) or paragraph 52(1A)(a); and  (b) must take the steps that are specified in a declaration included in the determination under subparagraph 52(1)(b)(ia) or paragraph 52(1A)(b) within the specified period; and  (c) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration included in the determination under subparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii) or paragraph 52(1A)(c). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 4  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e167802089d0c2cba53774f844304315624cfca2abefbe033e0265a45047b55d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must not repeat or continue conduct covered by a declaration included in the determination." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf, p.198" ;
    cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-55-2-norm .
