concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-80y a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80Y Conduct contravening more than one civil penalty provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-80y ;
    values:originalText "(1) If conduct constitutes a contravention of 2 or more civil penalty provisions, proceedings may be instituted under this Division against an entity in relation to the contravention of any one or more of those provisions.  (2) However, the entity is not liable to more than one pecuniary penalty under this Division in relation to the same conduct." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If conduct constitutes a contravention of 2 or more civil penalty provisions, proceedings may be instituted under this Division against an entity in relation to the contravention of any one or more of those provisions.  (2) However, the entity is not liable to more than one pecuniary penalty under this Division in relation to the same conduct."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9275540ea35fe85fba6bb7d48d7b1fba283b6a316ec5dfd5eb1fad2775ff5ed2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "209"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-80y-ss-1 ;
