    skos:prefLabel "80ZB Civil evidence and procedure rules for civil penalty orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-80zb ;
    values:originalText "The Federal Court or Federal Magistrates Court must apply the rules of evidence and procedure for civil matters when hearing proceedings for a civil penalty order. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
