concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-4-sec-193 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "193 Paragraph 82(7)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-193 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) at least one must be a person who has had at least 5 years’ experience at a high level in industry or commerce; and  (aa) at least one must be a person who has had at least 5 years’ experience at a high level in public administration, or the service of a government or an authority of a government; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (ab) at least one must be a person who has had extensive experience in health privacy; and" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) at least one must be a person who has had at least 5 years’ experience at a high level in industry or commerce; and  (aa) at least one must be a person who has had at least 5 years’ experience at a high level in public administration, or the service of a government or an authority of a government; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 4  Other amendments of the Privacy Act 1988  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012  Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (ab) at least one must be a person who has had extensive experience in health privacy; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f890ac7345bd4a007d66e9ac9e9e0554234c215f3fddfed6692273e250ddf23a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "211"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "At least one person must have specific experience in industry, public administration, or health privacy." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012.pdf> ;
