concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-5-sec-35l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35L Breach of requirement is an interference with privacy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-35l ;
    values:originalText "A breach of a requirement of this Division in relation to an individual constitutes an act or practice involving an interference with the privacy of the individual for the purposes of section 13 of the Privacy Act 1988. Note: The act or practice may be the subject of a complaint under section 36 of that Act. Australian Crime Commission Act 2002" ;
    skos:definition "A breach of a requirement of this Division in relation to an individual constitutes an act or practice involving an interference with the privacy of the individual for the purposes of section 13 of the Privacy Act 1988. Note: The act or practice may be the subject of a complaint under section 36 of that Act. Australian Crime Commission Act 2002"@en ;
