concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-1-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-1-3 ;
    values:originalText "In this Schedule: commencement time means the time Schedule 1 to this Act commences. Privacy Act means the Privacy Act 1988. transition period means the period:  (a) starting on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent; and  (b) ending immediately before the commencement time. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Application, transitional and savings provisions  Schedule 6 Provisions relating to Schedule 1 to this Act  Part 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15" ;
    skos:definition "In this Schedule: commencement time means the time Schedule 1 to this Act commences. Privacy Act means the Privacy Act 1988. transition period means the period:  (a) starting on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent; and  (b) ending immediately before the commencement time. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Application, transitional and savings provisions  Schedule 6 Provisions relating to Schedule 1 to this Act  Part 2  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15"@en ;
