concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-2-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Application—court/tribunal orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-2-3 ;
    values:originalText "The definition of court/tribunal order in subsection 6(1) of the Privacy Act, as inserted by Schedule 1 to this Act, applies in relation to an order, direction or other instrument made before or after the commencement time. 3  Saving—guidelines relating to medical research etc. (1) This item applies to guidelines if:  (a) the guidelines were issued or approved under subsection 95(1), 95A(2), 95A(4) or 95AA(2) of the Privacy Act; and  (b) the guidelines were in force immediately before the commencement time. (2) The guidelines have effect, after that time, as if they had been issued or approved under that subsection, as amended by Schedule 1 to this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 6  Application, transitional and savings provisions" ;
    skos:definition "The definition of court/tribunal order in subsection 6(1) of the Privacy Act, as inserted by Schedule 1 to this Act, applies in relation to an order, direction or other instrument made before or after the commencement time. 3  Saving—guidelines relating to medical research etc. (1) This item applies to guidelines if:  (a) the guidelines were issued or approved under subsection 95(1), 95A(2), 95A(4) or 95AA(2) of the Privacy Act; and  (b) the guidelines were in force immediately before the commencement time. (2) The guidelines have effect, after that time, as if they had been issued or approved under that subsection, as amended by Schedule 1 to this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Schedule 6  Application, transitional and savings provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "94bbe44ac8b5bd217d0d994638451f04b617fb0cc7e834a762fd5633da7e067c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "245"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of court/tribunal order applies to orders made before or after commencement time." ;
