concept:privacy-amendment-enhancing-privacy-protection-act-2012-sch-6-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Audits by the Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies if:  (a) before the commencement time, the Commissioner was conducting an audit under paragraph 27(1)(h) or (ha), 28(1)(e) or 28A(1)(g) of the Privacy Act; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Application, transitional and savings provisions  Schedule 6 Provisions relating to Schedule 4 to this Act  Part 5  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) immediately before that time, the audit has not been completed. (2) Despite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the Commissioner may continue, after the commencement time, to conduct the audit as if those amendments had not been made." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies if:  (a) before the commencement time, the Commissioner was conducting an audit under paragraph 27(1)(h) or (ha), 28(1)(e) or 28A(1)(g) of the Privacy Act; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00053  Application, transitional and savings provisions  Schedule 6 Provisions relating to Schedule 4 to this Act  Part 5  Privacy Amendment (Enhancing Privacy Protection) Act 2012 Compilation date: 12/3/14 Registered: 6/3/15  (b) immediately before that time, the audit has not been completed. (2) Despite the amendments of the Privacy Act made by this Act, the Commissioner may continue, after the commencement time, to conduct the audit as if those amendments had not been made."@en ;
